&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:0pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;（賃貸等不動産関係）&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18.0pt;font-size:9.0pt;"&gt;  賃貸等不動産の総額に重要性が乏しいため、記載を省略しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-26.9pt;line-height:13.0pt;font-size:13.0pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRealEstateForLeaseEtcConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
